uTube等への投稿。\n・グッズ化などの商用利用。\n　（商用利用が不可、条件がある場合は、値段調整 全然大丈夫です！）\n\n✜希望✜\n① wwwと満面の笑顔のイラスト\n\n② 両手をあげて「おはよー！」みたいなイラスト\n\n③ 降ってくるお金に喜んでいるイラスト\n\n④ ポンポンを持って応援しているイラスト\n\n（各イラストに、私の愛猫二匹を追加してほしいです。一匹は尻尾が長く、もう一匹は短いかぎしっぽです。こちらの希望は可能な範囲で問題ありません。描写が難しければ追加せずとも大丈夫です。）\n参考▶https://x.com/wan2_rice/status/1897917881742245989\n\n✜その他✜\n構図やポーズはお任せいたします。\nPSD形式で背景透過差分もお願いします。\nご検討、よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PEzolC6NCf-upw_JXqdbFPCz9xFoSMkR?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PEzolC6NCf-upw_JXqdbFPCz9xFoSMkR?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Mppp/works/225", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2314a306/uploads/origins/e9e24119-4be8-46d5-9f8c-95151ee057dc?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2b3d8eae55a5ba97184bbd5fd35067d8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2314a306/uploads/origins/e9e24119-4be8-46d5-9f8c-95151ee057dc?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2b3d8eae55a5ba97184bbd5fd35067d8, https://si.imgix.net/2314a306/uploads/origins/e9e24119-4be8-46d5-9f8c-95151ee057dc?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff7d0e6b2abced9f4fefa6d9d8d08f09 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2314a306/uploads/origins/e9e24119-4be8-46d5-9f8c-95151ee057dc?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1ccc34f332d7d1f58c7acf15007162d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I would love to request art from you since you have a very cute art style! My character is a very messy and tired Elf federal agent! She has eyebags and very messy hair! She is stinky. She is also an alcoholic, I would like you to draw her with alcohol bottles. She has a lot of bloody bandages and bruises! She is 156cm and has a very small stature! I would like her to be drawn as [REF1] Please include the PSD if possible! Thank you so much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1P751apvhPtZ1_xDNXWLHeC2fEXCsbpnm?usp=drive_link", "creat